alue of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and October to November came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those 75 years. In 2025, January to February came in at 21% of normal and June to July at 176%. All 6 grids had their driest year in 1988, with grid 26856 at 56% of normal. Grid 26854 shows a preliminary estimate of 196.9 for August to September 2026.</p>"}
